{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T11:34:55.519Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"49285cdb3ae2c9d3a7c09636","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-27T11:34:55.519Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Gates so far: typecheck clean, lint clean, docstring gate clean (27 files, 131 declarations), duplication 0%, identity:check 0 violations. pm health --strict-exit fails ONLY on the pre-existing local-environment warning extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew (a home-installed pm-github extension copy carries a newer pm-cli than the repo pin; tracked by the open local-extension-skew chore item; the repo tree is untouched by this work and fresh CI clones do not see it). Function-scope revert proofs run through the repo harness: linear heading scan and linear JSON whitespace both yield negativeControl fail 1 with sources restored byte-identically."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T11:34:55.519Z"}],"before_hash":"028792964aa8c7c1cf3ea1fb0ae5a0662b9e068c0479ef5971d2738f273ccd15","after_hash":"c09e57b22a22a8c0e3e6818a8f48afc6124ca1c67adbc4ddd63c88b483302225","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"24f63e02b806d1511bde230739789e7701f792342d467406afd4c96db819b179"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T11:53:44.496Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"49285cdb3ae2c9d3a7c09636","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-27T11:53:44.496Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Revert proof (both changed source files reverted to origin/main, then restored): heading-parity.test.ts fails to load ('does not provide an export named headingLines', suite 1 fail) and json-spans-linear.test.ts fails exactly once, the hostile-budget test measuring 1831.9ms on the retired tokenizer against its 400ms budget; after restoring the fix both files pass 7/7. The repo harness also proves the finer-grained function-scope reverts (linear heading scan, linear JSON whitespace): each yields exactly one isolated failure with byte-identical source restoration. The 50,000-space heading line takes ~1ms on the new parser; the retired regex demonstrably exceeds a 400ms deadline on a 3,200-char probe (killed child probe) and takes hours at full size."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T11:53:44.496Z"}],"before_hash":"c09e57b22a22a8c0e3e6818a8f48afc6124ca1c67adbc4ddd63c88b483302225","after_hash":"b42688f712f68db6fcfcd457a52494b7585f582099f7993a0b9c887a7b6f01ba","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"48a03d438d27d6fdbc2b1655bbe55e88f5ecfc9fd57d5dae5611497f284eac59"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-27T11:57:19.415Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"49285cdb3ae2c9d3a7c09636","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-27T11:57:19.415Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Correction on the revert harness: the JSON whitespace case I first added is withdrawn. The retired whitespace loop is also linear (only a constant factor slower), so its timing-based negative control straddles the budget under JIT variance (measured 1831ms on one run, 868ms on another against the 400ms budget) - a flaky control is worse than none, and the repo docs already acknowledge that an exactly equivalent pure refactor has no behavioral revert proof. The deterministic function-scope control stays for the heading parser (super-linear gap: ~0.2ms new vs ~1700ms retired on the 800-space probe). The JSON tokenizer's revert failure is evidenced by the file-level proof recorded above (budget test measured 1831.9ms on the reverted pair, 7/7 after restore)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-27T11:57:19.415Z"}],"before_hash":"b42688f712f68db6fcfcd457a52494b7585f582099f7993a0b9c887a7b6f01ba","after_hash":"00a92103b873588d69c767dc5971de03dc22426bd6e86bb0a8b4af28eb961722","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fb4d64655cf508d6872358b52aef37bb965b4844d7a8275c42eabcb1a4504f0e"}
